PTX rs-transposeB-smem-war
"RS mainloop with a transposed B: the MMA warpgroup's wgmma reads the transposed tile from smem, commits and waits for the group, then a named barrier; the transposing threads then overwrite the tile with the next one (CUTLASS transform/collective/sm90_wgmma_transpose.hpp:233-237, sm90_mma_tma_gmma_rs_warpspecialized.hpp:611-629). The wgmma must not read the new value 7. Expected: forbidden."
{
t=5 @cta 0;
c=0 @cta 0;
P0:r1=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0              | P1@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0 ;
 wgmma.fence.sync.aligned              | bar.sync 1, 2            ;
 wgmma.mma_async.sync.aligned r1, t, c | st.weak.shared::cta t, 7 ;
 wgmma.commit_group.sync.aligned       |                          ;
 wgmma.wait_group.sync.aligned 0       |                          ;
 bar.sync 1, 2                         |                          ;
exists
(P0:r1 == 7)
